  endButtons: {fileID: 57162739}
  firstObjective: Find a way through the forest.
  endingLines:
  - The radio crackles to life.
  - '"...anyone on this frequency... the lights took the whole valley... we''re heading
    north to the old dam..."'
  - A child's laugh, then static.
  - He knows that laugh.
  - The trail goes on.
